            <div xml:id="d607">

                <pb facs="0787" n="693" sameAs="frus:frus1924v02/pg693"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">852.75/10: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Spam</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Moore</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San Sebastian</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-09-03T15:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 3,
                                1924—3 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 7 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>41. Your 38, August 29, 7 p.m. As noted in royal decree, copy of which was
                    forwarded several months ago to the Department,<anchor n="16" xml:id="d607-f1"/>
                    the concession was open to proposals from all countries. There was only one
                    American company<anchor n="17" xml:id="d607-f2"/> which sought the concession.
                    The issue narrowed down to which telephone system should be adopted, the
                    American or the Swedish. I naturally thought that American system would be
                    favored by the Department. My assistance consisted in informing Spaniards that
                    American business interests always knew how to carry out big projects and that
                    the American telephone system was not equaled anywhere. In the future I shall
                    make no recommendations before receiving instructions from the Department. I am
                    forwarding by mail copies of the decree.<anchor n="16" xml:id="d607-f3"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Moore</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
